# Reference Knowledge

## Workspace paths

| Resource | Path |
|----------|------|
| **Workspace root** | `[YOUR_WORKSPACE_PATH]` |
| **Obsidian vault** | `[YOUR_OBSIDIAN_VAULT_PATH]` |
| **Skills directory** | `~/.claude/skills/` |
| **Memory directory** | `~/.claude/projects/[project]/memory/` |

## Key scripts

| Script | Path | Purpose |
|--------|------|---------|
| `obsidian_api.py` | `[path]` | Write to Obsidian via REST API |
| `oracle-commands` | `[path]` | Start/stop services (n8n, Ollama, ComfyUI) |

## Services

| Service | Port | Start command |
|---------|------|--------------|
| **n8n** (automations) | 5678 | `n8n start` |
| **Ollama** (local LLM) | 11434 | `ollama serve` |
| **ComfyUI** (image gen) | 8188 | `python main.py` |
| **Obsidian REST API** | 27123 | (start Obsidian) |

